    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/fcde8ed7ffa4037b5783955e06e88e22.webp?t=1722871263\" /></span><br><br>Welcome to the Cleanup Crew. <br><br>Take control of one of our resourceful agents, ready to go on dangerous missions without them knowing that they are actually disposable clones (convenient right?). <br><br>Scavenge anything of value, exterminate all in sight, and gather precious genetic material.<br><br>Infinite realities, apocalyptic planets, mindless zombie fairy tales hordes, AI-controlled robots, are all common everyday occurrences here. <br><br>Help the agents survive long enough to make profitable extractions, improve the team and your arsenal and get ready to go again! and again! AND AGAIN!<br><br><br><strong>CHOOSE</strong> your loadout from a pool of Clone Agents and Main Guns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/2e87edb2165095cf20e4dcd5e0896bed.poster.avif?t=1722871263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/2e87edb2165095cf20e4dcd5e0896bed.webm?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/2e87edb2165095cf20e4dcd5e0896bed.mp4?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CUSTOMIZE</strong> your build, choose from several Sub Weapons and Perks<br><strong>ACCOMPLISH</strong> emergent objectives that put your strategy and quick reactions to the test<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/e2e6b1c43890aea63fc8cf1a59cf8f48.poster.avif?t=1722871263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/e2e6b1c43890aea63fc8cf1a59cf8f48.webm?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/e2e6b1c43890aea63fc8cf1a59cf8f48.mp4?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>AQUIRE</strong>  valuable assets from weird wacky worlds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/90b0b96d945f72eb2d6ea81b06d4aab6.poster.avif?t=1722871263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/90b0b96d945f72eb2d6ea81b06d4aab6.webm?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SURVIVE</strong> by using each Agent's active skill.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/2ad81b3b7690a9e9912e92d52a89762c.poster.avif?t=1722871263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/2ad81b3b7690a9e9912e92d52a89762c.webm?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/2ad81b3b7690a9e9912e92d52a89762c.mp4?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>EXTRACT</strong> your Agent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/6bfc78895c22819dbe7390ea22e86722.poster.avif?t=1722871263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/6bfc78895c22819dbe7390ea22e86722.webm?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/6bfc78895c22819dbe7390ea22e86722.mp4?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CONQUER</strong> the Stage. After beating a stage you can unlock higher difficulties and enable Anomalies that change the gameplay of the stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/aadfa837509efdbf7e00ec2b315c7798.poster.avif?t=1722871263\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/aadfa837509efdbf7e00ec2b315c7798.webm?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2401090/extras/aadfa837509efdbf7e00ec2b315c7798.mp4?t=1722871263\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
